#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:5 a9dc8e02a3874726a2eb5b821e5ba23c
msgid "Simulation on Hardware"
msgstr "硬件上的仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:7 a46776561e8947ea9876ba462135a40d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's Simulation on Hardware is similar to features sometimes known as"
" \"Hardware in the Loop\".  Contrary to many of these systems, however, the "
"simulation is not run externally (with the resulting environmental data "
"passed to the vehicle), rather the vehicle's own autopilot runs both the "
"flight control software and the simulation.  ArduPilot's native SITL "
"simulation environment is reused for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"的“硬件上仿真”类似于有时被称为“硬件在环”的功能。然而，与许多此类系统不同，仿真并非在外部运行（再将得到的环境数据传递给飞行器），而是由飞行器自身的飞控同时运行飞行控制软件和仿真。ArduPilot"
" 原生的 SITL 仿真环境被复用于此目的。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:9 1bde2d7d47ff4b3b86dacfed80af04e0
msgid "Simulation on Hardware allows checking that:"
msgstr "硬件上的仿真可用于检查："

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:11 6188408cf9f04c3cbf8595d8da99f754
msgid "mission structure is correct"
msgstr "任务结构是否正确"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:12 f90b1a76b33b4b0bb63acf2bedd0c596
msgid "control surfaces move appropriately throughout a simulated mission"
msgstr "控制面在仿真任务中是否适当动作"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:13 d5930699d3ca4e39b055c5b6a07ddf55
msgid ""
"physical failsafes (e.g. parachutes) function appropriately without putting "
"a vehicle at risk"
msgstr "物理安全机制（例如降落伞）是否在不危及飞行器的情况下正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:14 34c958c1684e49a4aec281be1130ed23
msgid "communications infrastructure works in the face of real traffic"
msgstr "通信基础设施在真实流量下是否正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:18 c4ced81370fb4e72a91f23ea5f853733
msgid ""
"Simulation on Hardware is being improved all the time.  It is suggested you "
"run the master branch (\"latest\" firmware) to be able to take advantage of "
"any new features that have been added."
msgstr "硬件上的仿真一直在持续改进中。建议运行 master 分支（「最新」固件）以利用已添加的任何新功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:20 30baef93ac3f4cc4989a9d2fe6b26ca0
msgid ""
"The firmware is loaded on the autopilot and a GCS attached. The GPS initial "
"location data is provided by the simulation and can be changed with "
":ref:`SIM_OPOS_LAT<SIM_OPOS_LAT>`, :ref:`SIM_OPOS_LNG<SIM_OPOS_LNG>`, "
":ref:`SIM_OPOS_ALT<SIM_OPOS_ALT>` and :ref:`SIM_OPOS_HDG<SIM_OPOS_HDG>` "
"parameters. Setup, arming, and flying the simulation occurs as if "
"sim_vehicle.py and the associated physics models for the vehicle and frame "
"was used."
msgstr ""
"将固件加载到飞控上并连接地面控制站。GPS 初始位置数据由仿真提供，可通过 "
":ref:`SIM_OPOS_LAT<SIM_OPOS_LAT>`、:ref:`SIM_OPOS_LNG<SIM_OPOS_LNG>`、:ref:`SIM_OPOS_ALT<SIM_OPOS_ALT>`"
" 和 :ref:`SIM_OPOS_HDG<SIM_OPOS_HDG>` 参数进行更改。设置、解锁和飞行仿真的方式与使用 sim_vehicle.py "
"及其相关飞行器和机架物理模型相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:23 261a12915afc432dab73b153080cdd6f
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:25 e82d0287a3bd4d439c5190fd82c2eddb
msgid ""
"Parameter space is shared between the real aircraft and the simulated "
"aircraft.  This leads to problems with sensor calibration as the sensor "
"suite differs between the real and virtual aircraft.  Thus parameters must "
"be wiped and rewritten to the vehicle when moving between real and "
"simulation firmware."
msgstr ""
"真实飞行器和仿真飞行器共享参数空间。由于真实飞行器和虚拟飞行器的传感器套件不同，这会导致传感器校准方面的问题。因此，在真实固件和仿真固件之间切换时，必须清除并重新写入飞行器的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:26 3c76bf4b4f7f4074b01689079296b255
msgid ""
"Currently pre-compiled firmware for only Cube Orange QuadCopter autopilots "
"is available on the firmware server. The instructions below will allow "
"firmware to be compiled for other boards and vehicle types"
msgstr "目前固件服务器上仅提供 Cube Orange 四旋翼飞控的预编译固件。以下说明将允许为其他飞控板和飞行器类型编译固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:29 c1364f5cb506444c83b3746a43b4c77c
msgid "Save your parameters!"
msgstr "请保存您的参数！"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:31 fdb3004009214cabb24b74b1d6955cd4
msgid ""
"If you have been using the autopilot, be sure to save the parameters, "
"mission items, fences, and rally point to files to be able to reload them "
"later."
msgstr "如果您一直在使用飞控，请务必将参数、任务项、围栏和集结点保存到文件，以便日后重新加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:33 afe03c443c8b419fa77c89b4853e4970
msgid ""
"Once you have saved these to replace them after simulating, reset the "
"changed parameters by setting :ref:`FORMAT_VERSION<FORMAT_VERSION>` "
"parameter to zero and rebooting the vehicle. This allows new default to be "
"used in the simulation."
msgstr ""
"保存完毕后，通过将 :ref:`FORMAT_VERSION<FORMAT_VERSION>` "
"参数设置为零并重启飞行器来重置已更改的参数，从而在仿真中使用新的默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:35 29270a9553b3494fbcf2b66f3b3119b1
msgid ""
"with MAVProxy, once rebooted you need to \"FETCH\" params to refresh the "
"parameters to see them changed back to defaults, or dis-connect and re-"
"connect to the autopilot."
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy 时，重启后需要执行「FETCH」命令刷新参数，以查看参数已恢复为默认值，或者断开连接后重新连接飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:38 36d8a313521942ba93a28eef80731316
msgid "Pre-Compiled Firmware"
msgstr "预编译固件"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:40 466ccf3e7af848dd8ecb02c76f9b461e
msgid ""
"A pre-compiled binary for Cube Orange is provided at `our firmware server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__. It is available only in `Copter "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/CubeOrange-SimOnHardWare/>`__ "
"version, currently."
msgstr ""
"Cube Orange 的预编译二进制文件可在 `我们的固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上获取。目前仅提供 `Copter <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/CubeOrange-"
"SimOnHardWare/>`__ 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:42 e845b3d697f8466889203d33e0a34a2b
msgid ""
"Note that several features have been removed from this firmware, including "
"mount support."
msgstr "请注意，该固件已移除了多项功能，包括云台支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:45 c473eb7040a549149d77c14b6b1aa215
msgid "Compiling your own Firmware and Loading to AutoPilot"
msgstr "自行编译固件并加载到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:47 ab0590ba6a4645238a77dddac05fd604
msgid ""
"Simulation on Hardware is not compiled into the ArduPilot firmware by "
"default."
msgstr "硬件上的仿真默认不编译进 ArduPilot 固件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:49 6be927fa4c2f40f98d64edc50d8b5271
msgid ""
"If you have setup an :ref:`ArduPilot development environment <dev:building-"
"the-code>` you can add it to any ChibiOS hwdef file by adding the line ``env"
" SIM_ENABLED 1``.  Use the CubeOrange-SimOnHardware hwdef file (and default "
"parameter file!) as a reference."
msgstr ""
"如果您已设置好 :ref:`ArduPilot 开发环境 <dev:building-the-code>`，可以通过在任意 ChibiOS hwdef "
"文件中添加 ``env SIM_ENABLED 1`` 来启用它。请参考 CubeOrange-SimOnHardware hwdef "
"文件（以及默认参数文件！）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:51 979bc4ab8a9b4293b64b942962f4478b
msgid ""
"An flexible firmware building script is located `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/sitl-on-"
"hardware/sitl-on-hw.py>`__, which uses existing board's hwdef and builds the"
" firmware with the simulator.I"
msgstr ""
"一个灵活的固件构建脚本位于 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/sitl-on-"
"hardware/sitl-on-hw.py>`__，该脚本使用现有飞控板的 hwdef 并与仿真器一起构建固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:53 9e890faa7857434bb475e0289d407970
msgid ""
"first configure the build (example shown for CubeOrange, for QuadPlane Tilt "
"Tricopter) and upload to board"
msgstr "首先配置构建（示例为 CubeOrange，QuadPlane 倾转三旋翼），然后上传到飞控板："

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:59 e91f5355b88e45bc849447c83444d2b0
msgid "board: board target for firmware"
msgstr "board：固件的飞控板目标"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:60 cc24281c58314f93bcafc8e0888e7ec8
msgid "vehicle: plane/rover/copter/blimp, same as used by sim_vehicle.py"
msgstr "vehicle：plane/rover/copter/blimp，与 sim_vehicle.py 使用的相同"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:61 8b7ff7442512414b87e440b8691a8352
msgid "simclass: Plane/Multicopter/Helicopter/SimRover/Sailboat/QuadPlane"
msgstr "simclass：Plane/Multicopter/Helicopter/SimRover/Sailboat/QuadPlane"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:62 185a4198ed0f41c5a3b49b9c36d6fc3d
msgid ""
"frame: same as used by sim_vehicle.py, this modifies the physics model "
"according to which frame type is used, but unlike software based SITL it "
"does not also load a default set of params for this frame (like "
":ref:`Q_TILT_ENABLE<Q_TILT_ENABLE>` = 1, etc.). So they must be manually "
"added after the firmware is loaded."
msgstr ""
"frame：与 sim_vehicle.py 所用的相同，它会根据所用机架类型修改物理模型，但与基于软件的 SITL "
"不同，它不会同时为该机架加载默认参数集（如 :ref:`Q_TILT_ENABLE<Q_TILT_ENABLE>` = 1 "
"等），因此必须在固件加载后手动添加这些参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:63 da3cf9a11a0e4a68943f83af7896e145
msgid ""
"defaults: extra defaults file (optional). As shown,it will load the default "
"param file that sim_vehicle.py loads for the example frame. If omitted, a "
"minimal defaults.parm file is loaded to get most vehicles simulating. You "
"may want to create a file that sets up these necessary parameters for the "
"simulation (see below), the frame defaults, or the ones you are using on "
"your vehicle including the other parameters for specific hardware devices "
"you may wish to activate during the simulations(be sure not to change the "
"required parameters below)."
msgstr ""
"defaults：额外的默认参数文件（可选）。如示例所示，它将加载 sim_vehicle.py "
"为示例机架加载的默认参数文件。如果省略，则加载一个最小的 defaults.parm "
"文件使大多数飞行器能够仿真。您可能需要创建一个文件来设置仿真所需的参数（见下文）、机架默认参数，或您在飞行器上使用的参数，包括您希望在仿真期间激活的特定硬件设备的其他参数（请确保不更改下面所需的参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:65 0c6805624b804f2bb8c6adcf3c024ebe
msgid ""
"In order for the simulation to work and emulate flight while the autopilot "
"remains stationary, it will use simulated IMUs, GPS, and Compass."
msgstr "为使仿真正常工作并在飞控保持静止的情况下模拟飞行，它将使用仿真 IMU、GPS 和罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:68 38c9f3009d424053a2767cb192376081
msgid "Parameters needed for Simulation"
msgstr "仿真所需的参数"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:70 65e10411907045858c2b9db1962f6ee2
msgid "Connect a GCS."
msgstr "连接地面控制站。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:72 4cac28c798924c0eb453acc183954754
msgid ""
"In order for the simulation to work, the IMUs, GPS, and Compass sensors must"
" be simulated. The script above sets up these sensors so you do not have to,"
" as well as disabling the safety switch and IMU heater limits :"
msgstr "为使仿真正常工作，必须对 IMU、GPS 和罗盘传感器进行仿真。上述脚本会自动配置这些传感器，并禁用安全开关和 IMU 加热器限制："

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:74 da152331116a428ab638662e10d47b95
msgid ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:75 1710f72d35be4e65831943ee4a2d1d17
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 100"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 100"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:76 4adb879708df410a9239870e4c895f01
msgid ":ref:`SIM_MAG1_DEVID<SIM_MAG1_DEVID>` =  97539"
msgstr ":ref:`SIM_MAG1_DEVID<SIM_MAG1_DEVID>` = 97539"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:78 ca66a8df1a58475bb3292cf8536b5c72
msgid ""
"You may also need to have the correct parameters for your specific vehicle "
"frame, as mentioned above."
msgstr "如上所述，您可能还需要为特定飞行器机架设置正确的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:81 3278c3d234364a3daf3d8eac6d51a6aa
msgid "Starting at you home field"
msgstr "从您的主场地开始"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:83 294d17c557334c7e8c1151a3559db501
msgid ""
"You can set the simulation starting location by setting the following "
"parameters, otherwise the normal Canberra location will be used:"
msgstr "您可以通过设置以下参数来指定仿真起始位置，否则将使用默认的堪培拉位置："

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:85 107b34c2bf5a48a0836d510cf816531b
msgid ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_LAT<SIM_OPOS_LAT>`  in the form of -/+ X.xxx"
msgstr ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_LAT<SIM_OPOS_LAT>`，格式为 -/+ X.xxx"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:86 7e56162de77b4e42a757e78c90810ed9
msgid ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_LNG<SIM_OPOS_LNG>`"
msgstr ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_LNG<SIM_OPOS_LNG>`"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:87 23139b81809d4398a03161db9ebd1a44
msgid ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_ALT<SIM_OPOS_ALT>`  in meters AMSL"
msgstr ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_ALT<SIM_OPOS_ALT>`，单位为海拔高度（米）"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:88 08a1322470894e249b79714a2790c23a
msgid ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_HDG<SIM_OPOS_HDG>`  0-360 deg for initial heading"
msgstr ":ref:`SIM_OPOS_HDG<SIM_OPOS_HDG>`，初始航向，0-360 度"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:90 14360179bf324d6eb582e261c3372657
msgid "Reboot and reconnect the GCS. The simulation will be running."
msgstr "重启并重新连接地面控制站，仿真将开始运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:93 6e480b71cdfb461697563378c9acd8af
msgid "Using the Simulator"
msgstr "使用仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:95 b6d0555c2ff24d31b535d21df22b9511
msgid ""
"The simulator will behave almost identically to the SITL simulation on a PC."
" The autopilot, is now running the sims physics models and simulated "
"sensors. You will have to load parameters for your outputs, and any other "
"none default parameters for your specific vehicle, like relays, desired "
"failsafe actions, etc. you can specify a defaults file in the above script, "
"or load them manually after the firmware is loaded."
msgstr ""
"仿真器的行为与 PC 上的 SITL "
"仿真几乎相同。飞控现在运行仿真物理模型和仿真传感器。您需要加载输出参数以及飞行器特定的非默认参数，如继电器、期望的失控保护动作等。您可以在上述脚本中指定一个默认参数文件，也可以在固件加载后手动加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:97 9ed49a1338444717a726d768b3158ef2
msgid ""
"In order to arm the vehicle, provide RC input as normal to the autopilot - "
"or use MAVLink RC overrides to provide RC input. Just setting \"rc 3 1000\" "
"in MAVProxy will clear the RC not present pre-arm checks, and you can use "
"the ``rc x <pwm value>`` commands in place of RC, if you wish, or use an RC "
"receiver."
msgstr ""
"要解锁飞行器，请正常向飞控提供遥控输入，或使用 MAVLink RC 覆盖来提供遥控输入。在 MAVProxy 中只需设置「rc 3 "
"1000」即可消除「RC 不存在」的解锁前检查，如需要，您也可以使用 ``rc x <pwm value>`` 命令代替遥控，或使用遥控接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:99 bc04deb819644512a816d39ee3624924
msgid ""
"Copters require that the rudder input be sent or an RC override setting it "
"to neutral (ie rc 4 1500) in order for the yaw controller to operate "
"properly"
msgstr "多旋翼飞行器需要发送方向舵输入或通过 RC 覆盖将其设为中立（即 rc 4 1500），偏航控制器才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:101 32bee5a062ae47d3ba601fd28aa31796
msgid ""
"Wait for the vehicle to be ready to arm.  Try flying in the sim just as if "
"it were being software simulated,  monitoring the GCS, including graphing "
"actuator outputs, etc."
msgstr "等待飞行器准备好解锁。像软件仿真一样在仿真器中尝试飞行，监控地面控制站，包括绘制执行器输出图表等。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:103 edb2c2be2eaa40f5a90a2b924123bc19
msgid "A video showing build and operation is here:"
msgstr "展示构建和操作的视频如下："

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:109 badece7a814543faa5e4e65f3db7b401
msgid "Allowing actuators to move"
msgstr "允许执行器动作"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:113 489ffaad179b4a818bc1bed5bdf0a9dc
msgid ""
"Remove/disable all props or other dangerous actuators before continuing.  Be"
" prepared to cut power to servos should it become evident control surfaces "
"are straining.  Keep clear of entrapment or other hazards."
msgstr "继续之前请拆除或禁用所有螺旋桨或其他危险执行器。如果明显看到控制面用力拉伸，请准备好切断舵机电源。远离夹伤或其他危险。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:115 9ced64ffd5e440dbadecb482c5c7769d
msgid ""
"Servo/Motor outputs can be permitted to operate by setting the "
":ref:`SIM_OH_MASK<SIM_OH_MASK>` parameter.  The bits correspond to the servo"
" output channels, so to allow the first 4 channels to move set "
":ref:`SIM_OH_MASK<SIM_OH_MASK>` to 15."
msgstr ""
"可以通过设置 :ref:`SIM_OH_MASK<SIM_OH_MASK>` 参数允许舵机/电机输出动作。各位对应舵机输出通道，因此要允许前 4 "
"个通道动作，将 :ref:`SIM_OH_MASK<SIM_OH_MASK>` 设为 15。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:117 c7842868de034f66ab1ca82c2dafc646
msgid ""
"Relay outputs can be permitted to operate by setting the "
":ref:`SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK<SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK>` parameter. The bits correspond to "
"the relays, so to allow the first 2 relays to actuate set "
":ref:`SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK<SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK>` to 3."
msgstr ""
"可以通过设置 :ref:`SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK<SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK>` 参数允许继电器输出动作。各位对应继电器，因此要允许前 "
"2 个继电器动作，将 :ref:`SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK<SIM_OH_RELAY_MSK>` 设为 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:122 dad0b97d177f48d89bfeece857836387
msgid "Using SimuLink for physics simulation"
msgstr "使用 SimuLink 进行物理仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:124 57b4ce2a522041c694172dcc9607caad
msgid ""
"Ordinarily Simulation-on-Hardware uses ArduPilot's in-built physics models "
"for simulation.  Higher-fidelity simulations can be created in external "
"programs such as SimuLink, and it *is* possible use these external physics "
"models via the \"JSON\" mavlink backend."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下，硬件上的仿真使用 ArduPilot 内置的物理模型进行仿真。也可以在 SimuLink "
"等外部程序中创建更高精度的仿真，并通过「JSON」MAVLink 后端使用这些外部物理模型。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:126 c6939e4b3ac84aa8a65dffc610472a22
msgid ""
"The mechanism for doing this is perhaps best described by a shell script "
"which can be invoked to flash a CubeRedPrimary with a firmware which does "
"this."
msgstr "实现这一功能的机制可以通过一个 shell 脚本来最好地描述，该脚本可被调用以将具备此功能的固件刷写到 CubeRedPrimary 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:170 8a787286108a4c14a6e61a780b3d070e
msgid ""
"When invoked this script will build a firmware suitable for flashing to a "
"CubeRedPrimary board."
msgstr "调用此脚本后，将构建适合刷写到 CubeRedPrimary 飞控板的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sim-on-hardware.rst:172 aa7171a4a4434f879d498a74f25c7bf0
msgid ""
"The commented-out code does the same thing, but omits the actual sim-on-"
"hardware bit.  This allows you to make sure the networking is correct "
"without trying the sim-on-hardware bit.  Crucially, the board will not seem "
"to boot if the external physics simulation is not available!"
msgstr ""
"注释掉的代码实现相同功能，但省略了实际的硬件上仿真部分。这允许您在不尝试硬件上仿真的情况下确保网络配置正确。关键是，如果外部物理仿真不可用，飞控板将无法正常启动！"
